        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-K4020, Churchill Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Churchill Solid Brass Knocker is available in a wide array of finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. A traditional door knocker, it has old-world charm. The the Churchill front door knocker is 6-3/4 inches long and 3-3/4 inches wide. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Churchill Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
